        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>初中物理练习题 第2页</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n        displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 38px 20px;\n      background: #fafafa;\n      color: #303030;\n      font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 760px;\n      min-height: 1030px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 54px 76px 48px;\n      background: #fff;\n      border: 1px solid #555;\n      box-shadow: 2px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    .page::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -1px;\n      right: -1px;\n      width: 39px;\n      height: 39px;\n      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 48%, #555 49%, #555 52%, #eee 53%);\n      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 100%, 100% 0);\n    }\n\n    .page::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 7px;\n      left: 25px;\n      right: 43px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #888;\n    }\n\n    .pin {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -15px;\n      left: 6px;\n      z-index: 2;\n      width: 18px;\n      height: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .pin-head {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 4px;\n      top: 0;\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid #3f3a00;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #d9d321;\n      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 1px #fff;\n    }\n\n    .pin-body {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 5px;\n      top: 8px;\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border: 1px solid #4b4500;\n      border-radius: 2px;\n      background: #c9c21b;\n    }\n\n    .pin-point {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 8px;\n      top: 18px;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 11px;\n      background: #555;\n      transform: rotate(13deg);\n      transform-origin: top;\n    }\n\n    .top-problem {\n      min-height: 119px;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder {\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .placeholder figcaption,\n    .sr-only {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 1px;\n      padding: 0;\n      margin: -1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n\n    .pulley-diagram {\n      width: 115px;\n      height: 91px;\n      margin: 0 0 0 3px;\n    }\n\n    .pulley-diagram svg,\n    .incline-diagram svg,\n    .three-inclines svg {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .top-options {\n      margin-top: -2px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n    }\n\n    .questions {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 23px;\n    }\n\n    .questions > li {\n      padding-left: 4px;\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n    }\n\n    .question-text {\n      text-align: justify;\n    }\n\n    .options {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 22px;\n      margin-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 13.5px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    .options.single-line {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, max-content);\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      column-gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .math-options {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .math-options span {\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .incline-diagram {\n      width: 205px;\n      height: 72px;\n      margin: 3px 0 0 0;\n    }\n\n    .three-inclines {\n      width: 172px;\n      height: 94px;\n      margin: 2px 0 1px 0;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 10px;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      letter-spacing: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 47px;\n      bottom: 12px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    svg text {\n      fill: #222;\n      font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 810px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 12px 8px;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        width: 100%;\n        min-height: 0;\n        padding: 45px 9.5% 58px;\n      }\n\n      .top-options {\n        white-space: normal;\n      }\n\n      .options.single-line {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"pin-head\"></span>\n      <span class=\"pin-body\"></span>\n      <span class=\"pin-point\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"top-problem\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder pulley-diagram\">\n        <figcaption>[Diagram: pulley system at top-left]</figcaption>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 115 91\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"滑轮装置图\">\n          <defs>\n            <pattern id=\"hatch\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\">\n              <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"4\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n            </pattern>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"5\" y=\"38\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <text x=\"12\" y=\"51\" font-size=\"10\">4</text>\n          <rect x=\"0\" y=\"56\" width=\"33\" height=\"5\" fill=\"url(#hatch)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"26\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"47\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"57\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"67\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"72\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"62\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"62\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"78\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"58\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"82\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <rect x=\"58\" y=\"23\" width=\"24\" height=\"5\" fill=\"url(#hatch)\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"39\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n          <rect x=\"64\" y=\"80\" width=\"13\" height=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"70.5\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"70.5\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </figure>\n      <div class=\"top-options\">\n        A．F=90N；W=27J　 B．F=60N；W=54J　 C．F=30N；W=27J　 D．F=60N；W=18J\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <ol class=\"questions\" start=\"7\">\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          平直公路上的甲、乙两辆汽车，在相同牵引力作用下匀速行驶。如果在相同时间内通过的路程之比为3∶2，则甲与乙（　）\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options\">\n          <span>A．牵引力做功之比为2∶3</span>\n          <span>B．牵引力做功之比为3∶2</span>\n          <span>C．牵引力的功率之比为1∶1</span>\n          <span>D．汽车所受的阻力之比为3∶2</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          小明用40N的水平推力将一个重90N的箱子水平推动了1m，所用时间2s；小宇又将这个箱子匀速提上了0.4m高的台阶，所用时间1.5s。比较小明、小宇所做的功W₁、W₂和做功的功率P₁、P₂间大小的关系是（　）\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options math-options\">\n          <span>A．W₁&gt;W₂　 P₁&lt;P₂</span>\n          <span>B．W₁&gt;W₂　 P₁&gt;P₂</span>\n          <span>C．W₁&lt;W₂　 P₁&lt;P₂</span>\n          <span>D．W₁&lt;W₂　 P₁&gt;P₂</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          放在倾角为α斜面上的物体，对斜面的压力与物体重的关系是N=Gcosα，而摩擦力与压力成正比。如图所示，将同一物体，分别用F₁、F₂的推力，沿接触面粗糙程度相同的AB、AC两斜面从底端用相同时间匀速推到斜面顶端，推力F₁、F₂所做的功分别为W₁、W₂，做功的功率分别是P₁、P₂。下列说法正确的是（　）\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder incline-diagram\">\n          <figcaption>[Diagram: two inclined planes below question 9]</figcaption>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 205 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AB和AC两斜面图\">\n            <line x1=\"3\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"29\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"8\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"116\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"29\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M44 62 A15 15 0 0 1 41 54\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/>\n            <path d=\"M153 62 A15 15 0 0 0 157 51\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/>\n            <text x=\"112\" y=\"8\" font-size=\"11\">A</text>\n            <text x=\"24\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"11\">B</text>\n            <text x=\"166\" y=\"71\" font-size=\"11\">C</text>\n            <text x=\"42\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"10\">α</text>\n            <text x=\"151\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"10\">α</text>\n          </svg>\n        </figure>\n        <div class=\"options math-options\">\n          <span>A．W₁=W₂，P₁=P₂</span>\n          <span>B．W₁&gt;W₂，P₁&gt;P₂</span>\n          <span>C．W₁&lt;W₂，P₁&lt;P₂</span>\n          <span>D．W₁&gt;W₂，P₁&lt;P₂</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          A、B两物体分别在水平拉力作用下都做匀速直线运动，如果B所受的拉力是A的3倍，A的运动速度是B的4倍，在相同的时间内，拉力对A、B两物体做功之比是（　）\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"options single-line\">\n          <span>A．3∶4</span>\n          <span>B．8∶3</span>\n          <span>C．4∶3</span>\n          <span>D．24∶1</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          把一个重物以相同的速度沿AD、BD、CD三个光滑斜面匀速推向顶端，如图所示，则推力的功率是（　）\n        </div>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder three-inclines\">\n          <figcaption>[Diagram: three inclined planes below question 11]</figcaption>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 172 94\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AD、BD、CD三个斜面图\">\n            <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"11\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            <line x1=\"52\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"11\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            <line x1=\"132\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"11\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n            <text x=\"69\" y=\"10\" font-size=\"11\">D</text>\n            <text x=\"5\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"11\">A</text>\n            <text x=\"48\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"11\">B</text>\n            <text x=\"130\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"11\">C</text>\n          </svg>\n        </figure>\n        <div class=\"options single-line\">\n          <span>A．沿AD最大</span>\n          <span>B．沿BD最大</span>\n          <span>C．沿CD最大</span>\n          <span>D．一样大</span>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li>\n        <div class=\"question-text\">\n          用如图所示滑轮组，将质量为48kg的物体以0.3m/s的速度匀速提起，绳子自由端的拉力为200N；若用该滑轮组将重570N的物体匀速提升2m时，不计绳重、绳子的伸长和滑轮内部的摩擦，(g=10N/kg)，则（　）\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">初中物理</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number\">第 2 页</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
